  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to your perfect family beach getaway! This beautifully updated 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath bungalow in the Bungalows of Seagrove Beach offers everything you need for a relaxing and fun-filled vacation. Nestled in a peaceful, charming neighborhood tucked away from the busiest roads, this home provides a quiet retreat while still being just a short 5-minute walk to the public beach access across 30A. Enjoy the best of both worlds—tranquility and convenience!<br><br>Why We Love This Bungalow:<br><br><>Easy & Convenient Beach Access – Seagrove Beach boasts more public beach access points than many other 30A neighborhoods, with at least 10 access points along its scenic 2-mile stretch. Nearby Santa Clara Regional Beach Access offers restrooms, parking, and ADA accessibility, making it easy for everyone to enjoy a day at the beach.<br><br><>Charming & Quiet Neighborhood – Tucked away from the busiest areas, this peaceful community offers a relaxing escape while still being close to all the action.<br>Steps from the Pool – Let the kids splash and play while you unwind nearby.<br>Spacious & Comfortable – Open-concept living area with plenty of seating, plus a dining area featuring a beautiful custom reclaimed pine table, perfect for family meals.<br><br><>Fully Equipped Kitchen – Stainless steel appliances, breakfast bar, and all the cookware you need to prepare home-cooked meals—or better yet, skip the dishes and enjoy one of the many fantastic restaurants nearby, because cooking on vacation is overrated!<br><br><>Two Private Bedroom Suites – Each bedroom has its own en-suite bathroom and opens to a private balcony—ideal for morning coffee or winding down after a beach day.<br><br><>Kid & Parent-Approved Amenities – High-speed WiFi, flat-screen TVs, cable, and a full-size washer/dryer for convenience.<br><br><>Prime Location – Close to Seaside, WaterColor, and family-friendly restaurants, ice cream shops, and bike rentals—all accessible by bike or a short drive.<br><br><br><br><>This non-smoking, pet-free home is the ideal spot for families looking to create lasting beach memories. Book your stay today and experience the best of 30A’s stunning coastline!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Beach Bungalow, Quiet Neighborhood, Steps to Pool, Short Walk to Public Beach!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
